      "title": "Debugging with ChatGPT",
      "sourceHash": "3448c537df2ebda7bbd656093d67b577dd941aa704d293c4941cb748ec14f796",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.07,
          "end": 3.3,
          "en": "Now as a developer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.3,
          "end": 5.43,
          "en": "ChatGPT can be amazing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.43,
          "end": 10.11,
          "en": "for generating these individual application building blocks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.11,
          "end": 11.82,
          "en": "But it's not limited to that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.82,
          "end": 14.79,
          "en": "It's not limited to generating new code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.79,
          "end": 18.6,
          "en": "Instead, you can also use ChatGPT for debugging",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.6,
          "end": 21.57,
          "en": "to find and fix errors.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.57,
          "end": 22.62,
          "en": "And to do that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.62,
          "end": 24.24,
          "en": "you can report errors",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.24,
          "end": 26.46,
          "en": "that you are getting when running your code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 26.46,
          "end": 29.43,
          "en": "plus maybe any irrelevant code snippets",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 29.43,
          "end": 32.28,
          "en": "that might be needed to ChatGPT",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.28,
          "end": 34.53,
          "en": "to speed up the debugging process",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 34.53,
          "end": 37.41,
          "en": "and to find and fix errors quickly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 37.41,
          "end": 40.41,
          "en": "so that instead of going through the code manually,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 40.41,
          "end": 43.32,
          "en": "you can let ChatGPT help you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 43.32,
          "end": 47.55,
          "en": "And to show you how ChatGPT could be used for debugging,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.55,
          "end": 51.63,
          "en": "I built a very simple dummy Python project here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 51.63,
          "end": 53.88,
          "en": "a very simple Python program",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 53.88,
          "end": 56.973,
          "en": "that generates some dummy stock data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.14,
          "end": 60.78,
          "en": "Now, this program here contains a bug.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 60.78,
          "end": 61.613,
          "en": "And by the way,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 61.613,
          "end": 63.39,
          "en": "you find this file attached,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 63.39,
          "end": 65.13,
          "en": "and if you have Python installed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 65.13,
          "end": 68.1,
          "en": "you should be able to run this program.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 68.1,
          "end": 69.42,
          "en": "Or to be precise,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 69.42,
          "end": 72.66,
          "en": "you should not be able to run it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 72.66,
          "end": 74.49,
          "en": "because if I try to run it here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 74.49,
          "end": 75.87,
          "en": "I actually get an error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 75.87,
          "end": 79.08,
          "en": "as soon as I enter the amount of dummy data points",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 79.08,
          "end": 80.43299999999999,
          "en": "that should be generated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 81.57,
          "end": 84.48,
          "en": "I'm getting this error down here.",
