        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 105.24000000000001,
          "end": 107.61,
          "en": "And then we can go to ChatGPT",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 107.61,
          "end": 110.49000000000001,
          "en": "and we could start setting up our prompt like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 110.49000000000001,
          "end": 114.93,
          "en": "where we, again, specify our role and our goal here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 114.93,
          "end": 119.34,
          "en": "that we want ChatGPT to take a look at an existing code base",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 119.34,
          "end": 120.84,
          "en": "and suggest a solution",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 120.84,
          "end": 123.123,
          "en": "to a bug that's in that code base.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 123.99,
          "end": 125.566,
          "en": "And for that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 125.566,
          "end": 128.1,
          "en": "I then paste in that code base.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 128.1,
          "end": 130.56,
          "en": "If it would be a super long code base",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 130.56,
          "end": 133.02,
          "en": "that might not fit into one single prompt,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 133.02,
          "end": 135.84,
          "en": "you of course might want to copy the part",
