        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 141.75,
          "end": 145.17000000000002,
          "en": "regarding which part of the code is causing the error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 145.17000000000002,
          "end": 147.99,
          "en": "So, you could focus on that part.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 147.99,
          "end": 151.44,
          "en": "But here I'm simply taking the entire code base,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 151.44,
          "end": 155.46,
          "en": "and I then also add another piece of information,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 155.46,
          "end": 158.55,
          "en": "another piece of context to the prompt.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 158.55,
          "end": 161.52,
          "en": "I'll add the error message that I'm getting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 161.52,
          "end": 162.353,
          "en": "And for that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 162.353,
          "end": 165.09300000000002,
          "en": "I'll simply copy in this error message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 166.29,
          "end": 167.123,
          "en": "Like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 168.78,
          "end": 169.613,
          "en": "And with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 169.613,
          "end": 172.89,
          "en": "ChatGPT is now able to take a look at this code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 172.89,
          "end": 175.35,
          "en": "and hopefully suggest a solution",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 175.35,
          "end": 177.21,
          "en": "that does the trick.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 177.21,
          "end": 178.14,
          "en": "And indeed here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 178.14,
          "end": 181.47,
          "en": "it actually fives me the entire code base again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 181.47,
