          "en": "I should say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 184.313,
          "end": 187.44,
          "en": "But it also already told me what the problem is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 187.44,
